  "No storage settings on this device. Format the drive as FAT32 on a computer — every Android box accepts it.": "Cap de paramètre d'emmagazinatge sus aqueste aparelh. Formatatz lo disc en FAT32 sus un ordenador — cada bóstia Android o accèpta.",
  "No subtitles found.": "Cap de sostítol pas trobat.",
  "No title or IMDb id for this stream, so nothing to search by.": "Ni títol ni identificant IMDb per aqueste flux, doncas i a res per cercar.",
  "No torrents match this filter.": "Cap de torrent correspond pas a aqueste filtre.",
  "None": "Cap",
  "Normal": "Normal",
  "Normal speed": "Velocitat normala",
  "Not now": "Pas ara",
  "Not supported yet": "Pas encara pres en carga",
  "Nothing certain in the last twenty minutes — listening to the whole film…": "Res de segur dins las vint darrièras minutas — escota tot lo filme…",
  "Nothing chosen yet, so the background is a flat colour for now.": "Res es pas encara causit, doncas lo fons es una color unida per ara.",
  "Nothing downloading.": "Res se telecarga pas.",
  "Nothing here.": "I a pas res aicí.",
  "Nothing matches.": "Cap de correspondéncia.",
  "Nothing on this device can open that file. HEVC/x265 and AV1 depend on the hardware decoder, and older boxes have neither — try a 1080p x264 release.": "Res sus aqueste aparelh pòt pas dobrir aqueste fichièr. HEVC/x265 e AV1 dependon del descodificador material, e las bóstias mai ancianas n'an cap — ensajatz una publicacion 1080p x264.",
  "Nothing to play": "Res de legir",
  "Off": "Desactivat",
  "Off, your own background is left out of it: the theme keeps its own colours while the picture is up, and only moves when a title's artwork covers it.": "Desactivat, vòstre pròpri fons demòra a despart : lo tèma garda sas colors tant que l'imatge es visibla, e càmbia sonque quand l'illustracion d'un títol la cobrís.",
  "On the air": "En difusion",
  "On, the background follows whichever card you're pointing at or have selected. Off, it only changes when you actually open something — steadier on a long list, where sweeping across a row otherwise repaints the whole window card by card.": "Activat, lo fons seguís la carta que designatz o qu'avètz seleccionada. Desactivat, càmbia sonque quand dobrissètz vertadièrament quicòm — mai calm sus una lista longa, ont percórrer una linha redesenha autrament tota la fenèstra carta per carta.",
  "On, your picture is what the app rests on and the artwork covers it while you're on a film or show. Off, the picture stays put and nothing ever covers it.": "Activat, l'aplicacion repausa sus vòstra imatge e l'illustracion la cobrís tant que sètz sus un filme o una seria. Desactivat, l'imatge demòra ont es e res la cobrís pas jamai.",
  "One colour, and Material's own generator works out the rest of the palette from it.": "Una color, e lo generator de Material ne dedusís la rèsta de la paleta.",
  "One earlier episode in this season is still unwatched.": "Un episòdi precedent d'aquesta sason es pas encara vist.",
  "One earlier season is still unwatched.": "Una sason precedenta es pas encara vista.",
  "One-off or monthly, from any card or PayPal. Ko-fi takes no cut of it.": "Un còp o cada mes, amb quina carta que siá o via PayPal. Ko-fi ne pren pas cap de comission.",
  "Only download on Wi-Fi": "Telecargar sonque en Wi-Fi",
  "Only downloaded subtitles can be synced; the file's own tracks already match it.": "Sonque los sostítols telecargats pòdon èsser sincronizats ; las pistas del fichièr el meteis li correspondon ja.",
  "Only needed if the app stops loading artwork and titles. Create one free under your TMDB account settings, API, “API Read Access Token”. It is kept out of backup files.": "Necessari sonque se l'aplicacion daissa de cargar las illustracions e los títols. Creatz-ne un a gratis dins los paramètres de vòstre compte TMDB, API, « API Read Access Token ». Es gardat en defòra dels fichièrs de salvament.",
