  "That backup is empty.": "Aqueste salvament es void.",
  "That backup is in format {version}, which this build doesn't know how to read.": "Aqueste salvament es al format {version}, que aquesta compilacion sap pas legir.",
  "That doesn't look like a URL. Paste an addon link, or one starting with https://": "Sembla pas un URL. Pegatz un ligam d'extension, o un que comença per https://",
  "That file isn't JSON, so it isn't a backup.": "Aqueste fichièr es pas de JSON, doncas es pas un salvament.",
  "That isn't a Ventic backup.": "Es pas un salvament Ventic.",
  "That picture couldn't be saved. Try a smaller one, or a JPEG or PNG.": "Aquesta imatge a pas pogut èsser enregistrada. Ensajatz-ne una mai pichona, o un JPEG o PNG.",
  "That playlist is already in the list.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: That playlist is already in the list.",
  "That source is already in the list.": "Aquesta font es ja dins la lista.",
  "That torrent holds no video file.": "Aqueste torrent conten cap de fichièr vidèo.",
  "That's everything.": "Es tot.",
  "The connection to the torrent engine dropped mid-stream.": "La connexion al motor torrent es tombada al mitan del flux.",
  "The download couldn't be started.": "Lo telecargament a pas pogut començar.",
  "The download didn't finish.": "Lo telecargament s'es pas acabat.",
  "The exception is Dolby or DTS handed straight to a receiver over HDMI, which Android does where it can — nothing in the app touches that sound, so neither setting has any effect on it. An amplifier doing that has a night mode of its own.": "L'excepcion es lo Dolby o lo DTS mandat dirèctament a un receptor per HDMI, çò qu'Android fa ont pòt : res dins l'aplicacion tòca pas aqueste son, doncas cap dels dos reglatges i a pas d'efièch. Un amplificador que fa aquò a son pròpri mòde nuèch.",
  "The film is played as it was mixed.": "Lo filme passa tal coma es estat mesclat.",
  "The link this source gave answered HTTP {status}. It may have expired — search the sources again for a fresh one.": "Lo ligam donat per aquesta font a respondut HTTP {status}. Benlèu qu'es expirat — tornatz cercar dins las fonts per ne trobar un novèl.",
  "The link this source gave could not be reached.": "Lo ligam qu'aquesta font a donat a pas pogut èsser atench.",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "L'imatge qu'es ara darrièr l'aplicacion",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "La zòna del lector a pas jamai recebut de talha, doncas la lectura es pas estada lançada.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "Lo lector el meteis — descodatge, sostítols e àudio. GPLv2 o ulteriora.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Lo projècte albèrga pas, gerís pas, aproba pas e recomanda pas cap de font, e ne distribuís pas cap de lista.",
  "The project on GitHub": "Lo projècte sus GitHub",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "La publicacion pòrta cap de mesa a jorn per aquesta plataforma.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "La font o a ja recuperat — se legís tot d'un còp e daissa res sus aqueste aparelh",
  "The supporter list couldn't be loaded — the Ko-fi page above has the current one.": "La lista dels sostenidors a pas pogut èsser cargada — la pagina Ko-fi çai-dessús a l'actuala.",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Lo motor torrent a acceptat lo magnet mas li a donat cap d'identificant.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "Lo motor torrent, integrat dins l'aplicacion. Jos licéncia MIT.",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Lo flux torrent es pas encara prèst (lo motor a respondut HTTP {status}). Benlèu que recupèra encara las metadonadas dels pars.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "La mesa a jorn a pas pogut èsser installada : {error}",
  "Theme": "Tèma",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Aicí i a a pena la plaça per un filme. Brancatz una clau USB sus la bóstia — formatada en FAT32, çò que cada bóstia Android accèpta — e apareisserà çai-sus per i telecargar puslèu.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "I a cap de compte ont se connectar e res se sincroniza pas cap a un servidor. Çò que gaitatz, fins ont sètz arribats, vòstres favorits e vòstra lista de visionatge son totes gardats sus aqueste aparelh e lo quitan pas jamai. La sincronizacion entre ecrans es prevista ; d'aquí enlà, lo salvament çai-jos es lo mejan per desplaçar una bibliotèca.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "I a cap de {file} dins vòstre dorsièr de documents. Copiatz-ne un aquí e tornatz ensajar.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Aquesta connexion es mesurada ara meteis.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Aquesta connexion es pas mesurada ara meteis.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "Aquesta còpia es pas estada installada per l'installador de Ventic — mas per un gestionari de paquets, o compilada dempuèi las fonts — doncas çò que l'a botada aquí es çò que la met a jorn. Remplaçar los fichièrs d'aicí lo confondriá solament.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Lo descodificador d'aqueste aparelh a abandonat aqueste fichièr. Es generalament l'àudio : Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) e DTS son pas jos licéncia dins la vista web del sistèma, doncas una publicacion que ne pòrta un se legís coma un imatge sens son, o pas del tot. Una publicacion x264 amb àudio AAC se legirà.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Aqueste fichièr a una sola pista àudio.",
  "Timing": "Sincronisme",
  "Tint": "Tenchura",
  "Title": "Títol",
  "Too big for the download drive": "Tròp grand pel disc de telecargament",
  "Top rated": "Melhor notats",
  "Torrent engine offline.": "Motor torrent fòra linha.",
