  "Try again": "Tornar ensajar",
  "Turn subtitles on by themselves whenever a film starts, in the language you pick here.": "Alucar los sostítols tot sols quand una pellicula comença, dins la lenga que causissètz aicí.",
  "Turns off the effects that cost the most to draw: the frosted blur behind the sidebar and menus, the blur on the background art, and the fades and slides that play as things appear or take focus. Everything stays where it was and nothing is hidden — it stops moving and goes crisp instead. Loading spinners keep turning.": "Desactiva los efièches los mai costoses a dessenhar : lo fosc satinat darrièr la barra laterala e los menús, lo fosc sus l'illustracion de fons, e los fondiments e lisaments que se legisson quand quicòm apareis o pren lo focus. Tot demòra ont èra e res es pas amagat — s'arrèsta simplament de bolegar e ven net. Los indicadors de cargament contunhan de virar.",
  "Type in the search box to find movies and shows.": "Picatz dins la casa de recèrca per trobar de filmes e de serias.",
  "Unmute (m)": "Restablir lo son (m)",
  "Unreadable": "Illegible",
  "Untitled": "Sens títol",
  "Upcoming": "Bèn lèu",
  "Update now": "Metre a jorn ara",
  "Updates": "Mesas a jorn",
  "Updates are checked in the installed app, not here.": "Las mesas a jorn son verificadas dins l'aplicacion installada, pas aicí.",
  "Upload": "Mandadís",
  "Use default": "Utilizar la valor per defaut",
  "Use the usual settings": "Utilizar los reglatges costumièrs",
  "Use this colour": "Utilizar aquesta color",
  "Using the usual audio settings": "S'utilizan los reglatges àudio costumièrs",
  "Ventic asks a source for {movie}, or {series}, and expects a {streams} array back. Add several and their results are merged, with duplicates dropped and earlier sources preferred.": "Ventic demanda a una font {movie}, o {series}, e espèra en retorn un tablèu {streams}. Ajustatz-ne mantunas e lors resultats son fusionats, los doblons son levats e las fonts ajustadas d'en primièr son preferidas.",
  "Ventic downloads the new package and Android asks you to confirm the install. It is signed with the same key as the copy you have, so it upgrades in place and keeps your library.": "Ventic telecarga lo paquet novèl e Android vos demanda de confirmar l'installacion. Es signat amb la meteissa clau que la còpia qu'avètz, doncas se met a jorn sul lòc e garda vòstra bibliotèca.",
  "Ventic has no sources configured, so there is nowhere to search. You can still play a magnet or a torrent file you open yourself.": "Ventic a cap de font configurada, doncas i a enluòc per cercar. Podètz totjorn legir un magnet o un fichièr torrent que dobrissètz vos meteis.",
  "Ventic hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.": "Ventic albèrga cap de contengut, ne indexa cap e es liurat sens cap de font configurada. Es un client BitTorrent amb un lector integrat : recupèra sonque çò que li designatz, dempuèi de servidors qu'avètz ajustats vos meteis.",
  "Ventic is MIT licensed. The components it is built on keep their own terms, listed above; on Windows the bundled mpv is GPL software and its licence and offer of source sit next to the application's executable.": "Ventic es jos licéncia MIT. Los components sus los quals repausa gardan lors pròprias condicions, listadas çai-sus ; sus Windows lo mpv inclús es un logicial GPL e sa licéncia e son ofèrta de còdi font son al costat de l'executable de l'aplicacion.",
  "Ventic is free, has no ads, no account and nothing to sell. It costs money to sign, host and keep running — a donation is what covers that, and nothing in the app changes whether you give one or not.": "Ventic es gratuit, sens publicitat, sens compte e a res de vendre. Lo signar, l'albergar e lo manténer en marcha còsta d'argent — un don es çò que o cobrís, e res dins l'aplicacion cambia pas que ne fagatz un o non.",
  "Ventic is up to date.": "Ventic es a jorn.",
  "Ventic keeps your library on this device. Carrying it to another screen is the backup file below.": "Ventic garda vòstra bibliotèca sus aqueste aparelh. Per la portar cap a un autre ecran i a lo fichièr de salvament çai-jos.",
  "Ventic searches nothing by itself. A source is a URL you add here, pointing at a server that answers with things to play. What a source offers, and whether you have the right to play it, is between you and whoever runs it.": "Ventic cèrca res tot sol. Una font es un URL qu'ajustatz aicí, qu'apunta cap a un servidor que respond amb de causas de legir. Çò qu'una font prepausa, e se avètz lo drech de o legir, es una afar entre vos e qual la gerís.",
  "Ventic speaks the {protocol}. Any Stremio addon URL works here — paste the {link} link or the {manifest} address and it'll be trimmed to what's needed.": "Ventic parla lo {protocol}. Quin URL d'extension Stremio que siá fonciona aicí — pegatz lo ligam {link} o l'adreça {manifest} e serà retalhat a çò que cal.",
  "Ventic will send it the title you're looking for and play what it hands back. Only add servers you trust — this one is not run by, or checked by, this app.": "Ventic li mandarà lo títol que cercatz e legirà çò que tornarà. Ajustatz sonque de servidors que vos fisatz — aqueste es pas gerit ni verificat per aquesta aplicacion.",
  "Ventic {version} is out": "Ventic {version} es sortit",
  "Version {version}": "Version {version}",
  "Vertical position": "Posicion verticala",
